{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Inspect and record condition\n\n**Return** {{returnId}} · **order** {{orderId}} · **customer** {{customerEmail}}\n\nOpen the parcel and record the condition of every item. The values are the same as in the gRPC condition service.",
      "id": "Text_17",
      "layout": {
        "row": "row_0",
        "columns": null
      }
    },
    {
